{"detail": {"templateUuid": "3abae902e01d4f0badc61a34a5edcee3", "projectUuid": "c86c9bd3fff64b339d8cbf88bd887253", "name": "手持呼吸震颤·真实街拍质感短片", "description": "这条片子，镜头从头晃到尾。\n不是AI抽风。是我故意的。\n我给它写了动态模糊、写了呼吸震颤、写了曲线变速。每一个抖动的频率，都是写进提示词里的。\n泡泡破裂，画面震一下。鞋底扫过镜头，黑屏。她凑近说“嘘”，镜头跟着心跳一起颤。\nAI不知道什么叫真实感。但你告诉它怎么晃，它就还你一条像真的。\n后期没加任何配乐。全程同期声。脚步声、呼吸声、泡泡破裂那一声脆响。够了。\n这就是手持呼吸震颤·真实质感。不是拍出来的，是写出来的。\n提示词格式：【视频核心】【人物】【视觉风格】【画面描述】【场景】【镜头语言】【声音】【动感参数设定】【特效】【转场】【动画 In / Out / Combo 画面运镜动画】【核心逻辑】。", "coverUrl": "/assets/8d7fe93944116b2b.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/46987de339ac47e0965172f7ccd1b939/8e7c8b9ce88cf166a1c5ef4dfc8b9f5ffdabbc6a.mp4", "snapshotId": 17893, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 839640, "ownerUuid": "46987de339ac47e0965172f7ccd1b939", "avatar": "/assets/bce6807b12ca42f8.webp", "nickname": "野猪A6", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 113, "tags": [{"id": 1402, "code": "vlog", "tagLabel": "vlog", "parentTag": 1400, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1400/1402/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1405, "code": "talent", "tagLabel": "才艺颜值", "parentTag": 1400, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1400/1405/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 5, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1503, "code": "teaching", "tagLabel": "教学教程", "parentTag": 1500, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1500/1503/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.douyin.com/video/7649316041083948315", "createAt": "2026年06月09日 16:59", "updateAt": "2026年07月02日 20:26", "publishAt": "2026年06月09日 16:59", "playCount": 232, "viewCreati